# HostFlow product contract

HostFlow is an **operational platform** (not CRM/ATS/HRM).

## Phase 1 — verify before build (ACTIVE)

**Now:** Manual UI verification of Flow Breaks **#1–#6** on Candidates.

**Not:** «сделай DataTable» or jump to #7.  
**Yes:** «пройди Decision Flow» — user behavior only, not code review.

> Code merged ≠ break closed. Break closes only when **UI cannot reproduce it**.

**Log:** [`decision-flow-breaks-log.md`](docs/specs/architecture/decision-flow-breaks-log.md)

## Gate

1. Verify #1–#6 in real UI (checkboxes in log).  
2. Re-rank open breaks **P0 → P1 → P2** (flow impact, not # order).  
3. Fix highest **P0** next (#9 may beat #7).

## Filters

1. UI verification or fixing a **reproducing** break?  
2. Are #1–#6 verified? If not — no #7+ work.

## Phase 0 — frozen

Platform Canon — change rarely.

